                <note rend="inline" type="source">339.3921L96/33: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in the Dominican Republic</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Russell</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Santo Domingo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1920-10-23T17:00:00-04:40"><hi rendition="#italic">October 23,
                                1920—5 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received October 25—4:10
                        p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>49. Journalists Sanabia and Castillo placed at liberty under surveillance. There
                    are now no journalists imprisoned.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Russell</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
